sequenceDiagram
    participant S as 发送方
    participant R as 接收方

    S->>S: proto_message_t
    S->>S: serialize_msg()
    Note right of S: Magic → htons<br/>Status → htons<br/>Payload_len → htonl<br/>Checksum → htonl

    S->>R: send_all(header + payload)

    R->>R: recv_all(header 15字节)
    R->>R: parse_header()
    Note left of R: ntohs 还原各字段<br/>验证 Magic == 0xF1F2

    R->>R: recv_all(payload N字节)
    R->>R: calculate_crc(payload)

    alt CRC匹配
        R-->>S: 处理成功
    else CRC不匹配
        R-->>S: 返回错误
    end